announcements list, in which the Admin and general stuff could be posted,
thus cutting down on the volume and technical stuff they get. Lojbab has
proposed it before, and it's a good idea: I can see no reason why it should
not be implemented. Presumably, Lojbab and John only need post to it,
which means it needn't be a proper mailing list at all, just an alias
for two hundred-odd addresses.

